{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/bringing-together-the-administration-of-pensioner-housing-benefit-and-pension-credit","content_id":"98703be2-abfd-4871-9f40-b8c751192300","description":"A joined-up service enabling eligible customers to claim Housing Benefit and Pension Credit together from autumn 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9393088","isbn":"","title":"Administration of Housing Benefit and Pension Credit","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/bringing-together-the-administration-of-pensioner-housing-benefit-and-pension-credit/administration-of-housing-benefit-and-pension-credit"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Work is ongoing to deliver a new joined-up service for customers to apply for pensioner Housing Benefit and Pension Credit together.</p>\n\n<p>Through bringing together the administration of pensioner Housing Benefit and Pension Credit, we are designing a service which is easy to use to enable more pensioners to receive the benefits they are entitled to. </p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-14T08:17:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["b548a09f-8b35-4104-89f4-f1a40bf3136d"],"featured_attachments":["9393088"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-14T09:17:00.000+01:00","political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-14T09:17:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/bringing-together-the-administration-of-pensioner-housing-benefit-and-pension-credit","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/bringing-together-the-administration-of-pensioner-housing-benefit-and-pension-credit","base_path":"/government/publications/bringing-together-the-administration-of-